=== 6. structural comparison: does hkz_route_ii's body textually match hkz_profile (measure_relvar.py) or lll_reduce/enumerate_svp (measure_route_reimpl.py) beyond the licensed formula reuse? ===
  hkz_route_ii (measure_hkz_indep.py) constructs GSO via GSO.Mat(A, float_type="double") -- BASIS-based.
  hkz_profile (measure_relvar.py, ROUTE-P) constructs GSO via GSO.Mat(A, gram=True) -- GRAM-based.
  lll_reduce/enumerate_svp (measure_route_reimpl.py, BATCH-6e08fe ROUTE-I') use NO fpylll at all (pure numpy).
  These are three structurally distinct code paths; confirmed by direct read (see validation_report.yaml).

